xture of the fur, not just its color. Things that appear in their homid or Crinos features, not their lupus ones. Shape and proportions of the head, tail, bone structure, or other parts of the body. Things like the gait or stride when they walk or run. Their scent. The Garou's temperament, demeanor, or bearing. How confidant, alert, serene, or composed they seem even in emotionally charged situations. Even as humans we say things like this person has a regal bearing or displays class.<br /> <br /> One thing I also do is select one attribute associated with a particular line of Garou with Pure Breed, and have that show up in some format of the Garou of that line. It could be a particular nose shape, bushy eyebrows, strong jaws, chin dimples, piercing eyes, large hands or feet, a particular pattern that shows on their lupus form, or anything else that might distinguish that line. I am also quite fond of giving common Merits or Flaws to NPCs of those lines, particularly Flaws that mimic the classic &quot;tells&quot; of werewolves like Banned Transformation, Forced Transformation, Mark of the Predator, or Sign of the Wolf. It's a way to show Pure Breed in general while distinguishing the Pure Breed of this particular family from others.</div> </div> </div> </div> I tend to assume that the key element to Get of Fenris Pure Breed is looking like the Big Bad Wolf BUT VIKING!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28339-atticus-cleanclaw","name":"Atticus Cleanclaw","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"638"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-27T14:07:32-08:00","id":1555922,"title":"","content":"One slightly more serious addition is that I suspect \u2018Pure Breed\u2019 looks make more sense if you start imagining WEREWOLF: THE APOCALPYSE with more of an impressionistic/Stylised, Saturday Morning Cartoon aesthetic than anything scientifically-accurate or photorealistic. <br /> <br /> Let\u2019s face it, WtA would make an absolutely Ripper cartoon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28339-atticus-cleanclaw","name":"Atticus Cleanclaw","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"638"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-27T14:48:01-08:00","id":1555925,"title":"","content":"To avoid any implication of a specific media form, I tend to frame it similarly by saying that WtA is based on stereotypes rather than reality.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}